{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"MAT","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"馬太福音","commonName":"馬太福音","title":"馬太福音","order":40,"numberOfChapters":28,"sha256":"e6a69bcdfd211081fa073a66ee44527641bf01e2b254542670bcdb48a7363864","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/MAT/1.json","lastChapterNumber":28,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/MAT/28.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1071},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["開路先鋒"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["那時，施洗者約翰來到猶太的曠野傳道，說："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「悔改吧，因為天國臨近了！」"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["以賽亞先知曾說：「有人在曠野大聲呼喊，『預備主的道，修直祂的路。』」",{"noteId":8},"他指的就是約翰。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["約翰身穿駱駝毛的衣服，腰束皮帶，吃的是蝗蟲和野蜜。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["那時，耶路撒冷、猶太各地和約旦河一帶的人都來到約翰那裡，"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["承認他們的罪，在約旦河裡接受他的洗禮。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["約翰看見很多法利賽人和撒都該人也來受洗，就對他們說：「你們這些毒蛇的後代！誰指示你們逃避那將臨的烈怒呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["你們要結出與悔改相稱的果子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["不要心裡說，『我們是亞伯拉罕的子孫。』我告訴你們，上帝可以從這些石頭中興起亞伯拉罕的子孫。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["現在斧頭已經放在樹根上了，凡不結好果子的樹都要被砍下，扔進火裡。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["我用水給你們施洗，叫你們悔改。但在我之後，有一位比我更有能力的要來，我連給祂提鞋都不配。祂要用聖靈和火給你們施洗。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["祂手裡拿著簸箕，要揚淨祂的麥場，把麥子收進倉庫，用不滅的火把糠秕燒盡。」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶穌受洗"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["後來，耶穌從加利利來到約旦河受約翰的洗禮。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["約翰想要攔住祂，就說：「我需要受你的洗，你反倒來找我嗎？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["耶穌答道：「你暫且這樣做吧！我們理當這樣履行一切的義。」於是約翰答應了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["耶穌受了洗，剛從水裡上來，天就開了。祂看見上帝的靈像鴿子一樣降在祂身上，"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["又有聲音從天上傳來：「這是我的愛子，我喜悅祂。」"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":8,"caller":"+","text":"以賽亞書40·3。","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":3}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/MAT/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/MAT/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/MAT/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}